    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Magic action: the three tentacles each attack a creature within 15 ft (+9 to hit, 1d6 Psychic) - use <strong>Tentacle</strong> three times. If all three hit the same creature, it makes a DC 15 DEX save (rolled for you) or has the Restrained condition: it takes 3d6 Psychic damage at the start of each of its turns and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns. Release it by deleting the effect.</p>",
